   "seed": 115948851,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 980634927,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "TWO COORDINATE SYSTEMS PER HAND\n\nimage[k] = (x, y, z)   x, y in 0..1 of the mirrored frame,\n                       x right, y down, z relative depth\nworld[k] = (X, Y, Z)   metres, origin at the hand's centre\n\nPoses are measured in world, which does not change with where the\nhand is. Screen position, the chin test and clap distance use image.",
   "originalText": "TWO COORDINATE SYSTEMS PER HAND\n\nimage[k] = (x, y, z)   x, y in 0..1 of the mirrored frame,\n                       x right, y down, z relative depth\nworld[k] = (X, Y, Z)   metres, origin at the hand's centre\n\nPoses are measured in world, which does not change with where the hand is. Screen position, the chin test and clap distance use image.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "ht0115",
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "ht0117",
