   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "TIMESTAMPS\n\nstamp = max(floor(1000 · t_capture), last_stamp + 1)   ms\n\nMediaPipe needs strictly increasing stamps. The map from stamp back\nto t_capture is kept 2 s; frames MediaPipe drops never call back.",
   "originalText": "TIMESTAMPS\n\nstamp = max(floor(1000 · t_capture), last_stamp + 1)   ms\n\nMediaPipe needs strictly increasing stamps. The map from stamp back to t_capture is kept 2 s; frames MediaPipe drops never call back.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "ht0117",
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
   "autoResize": true
  },
