   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "MIRRORING FLIPS HANDEDNESS\n\nThe frame is mirrored before inference, so MediaPipe's label is the\nuser's other hand. Engine.side() undoes it: \"Right\" is the user's\nleft. Left is drawn sky blue, right coral.",
   "originalText": "MIRRORING FLIPS HANDEDNESS\n\nThe frame is mirrored before inference, so MediaPipe's label is the user's other hand. Engine.side() undoes it: \"Right\" is the user's left. Left is drawn sky blue, right coral.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "ht0119",
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
   "autoResize": true
  },
