   "text": "LATENCY AND FRAME RATE (DIAGNOSTICS)\n\nlatency ← latency + 0.1·(1000·(now − t_capture) − latency)  ms\nfps = number of samples received in the last 1 s",
   "originalText": "LATENCY AND FRAME RATE (DIAGNOSTICS)\n\nlatency ← latency + 0.1·(1000·(now − t_capture) − latency)  ms\nfps = number of samples received in the last 1 s",
