   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 219380805,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "ASSOCIATION COST\n\np = mean(image[0], image[5], image[17]) in x, y\nd = ‖p_track − p_k‖\n\nc(track, k) = ∞                           if d > 0.30\n            = d + 0.15·[label differs]    otherwise\n\nassignment = argmin Σ c(track, k)\n             over all one-to-one pairings\n\nIdentity follows position first and handedness second, so two hands\nthat cross keep their ids even if MediaPipe swaps the labels for a\nframe.",
   "originalText": "ASSOCIATION COST\n\np = mean(image[0], image[5], image[17]) in x, y\nd = ‖p_track − p_k‖\n\nc(track, k) = ∞                           if d > 0.30\n            = d + 0.15·[label differs]    otherwise\n\nassignment = argmin Σ c(track, k)\n             over all one-to-one pairings\n\nIdentity follows position first and handedness second, so two hands that cross keep their ids even if MediaPipe swaps the labels for a frame.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "ht0190",
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
   "autoResize": true
  },
