   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Finger landmarks → 1€ filter  [4 Hz, β 60]\nAll 21 world points, each with a cutoff from its own\nspeed, so one moving fingertip does not let the jitter\nof the still ones through. Poses are read from these.",
   "originalText": "Finger landmarks → 1€ filter  [4 Hz, β 60]\nAll 21 world points, each with a cutoff from its own speed, so one moving fingertip does not let the jitter of the still ones through. Poses are read from these.",
