   "text": "MotionTrack.step(now), every tick\nExtrapolate along the velocity by the sample's age, at\nmost 50 ms, so a lost hand coasts to a stop. A 12 ms\nexponential follow hides the correction when a new\nsample lands.",
   "originalText": "MotionTrack.step(now), every tick\nExtrapolate along the velocity by the sample's age, at most 50 ms, so a lost hand coasts to a stop. A 12 ms exponential follow hides the correction when a new sample lands.",
