   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1€ FILTER (CASIEZ, ROUSSEL, VOGEL 2012)\n\nα(Δt, f) = 1 / (1 + τ/Δt),     τ = 1 / (2π f)\n\nv′ ← v′ + α(Δt, f_d)·((x − x′)/Δt − v′)    speed, low-passed\nf_c = f_min + β·‖v′‖                     cutoff rises with speed\nx′ ← x′ + α(Δt, f_c)·(x − x′)            the filtered value\n\nx is the raw sample, x′ the filtered one. Slow motion is smoothed\ndown to f_min (no jitter); fast motion raises the cutoff (no lag).\nf_d = 1 Hz.\n\nsignal                  unit             f_min    β\npalm position           screen heights   1.5 Hz   12\nfinger landmarks        metres           4.0 Hz   60\nscroll tilt, knob turn  degrees          1.0 Hz   0.03\nface points             frame heights    1.0 Hz   4",
   "originalText": "1€ FILTER (CASIEZ, ROUSSEL, VOGEL 2012)\n\nα(Δt, f) = 1 / (1 + τ/Δt),     τ = 1 / (2π f)\n\nv′ ← v′ + α(Δt, f_d)·((x − x′)/Δt − v′)    speed, low-passed\nf_c = f_min + β·‖v′‖                     cutoff rises with speed\nx′ ← x′ + α(Δt, f_c)·(x − x′)            the filtered value\n\nx is the raw sample, x′ the filtered one. Slow motion is smoothed down to f_min (no jitter); fast motion raises the cutoff (no lag). f_d = 1 Hz.\n\nsignal                  unit             f_min    β\npalm position           screen heights   1.5 Hz   12\nfinger landmarks        metres           4.0 Hz   60\nscroll tilt, knob turn  degrees          1.0 Hz   0.03\nface points             frame heights    1.0 Hz   4",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "ht0212",
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
   "autoResize": true
  },
