   "locked": false,
   "text": "VELOCITY, PREDICTION, FOLLOW\n\nper sample:\n  v ← v + α(Δt, 5 Hz)·((x′_t − x′_t−1)/Δt − v)\n\nper tick:\n  lead   = clamp(now − t_sample, 0, 50 ms)\n  target = x′ + v·lead\n  shown ← shown + (1 − e^(−Δt/12 ms))·(target − shown)",
   "originalText": "VELOCITY, PREDICTION, FOLLOW\n\nper sample:\n  v ← v + α(Δt, 5 Hz)·((x′_t − x′_t−1)/Δt − v)\n\nper tick:\n  lead   = clamp(now − t_sample, 0, 50 ms)\n  target = x′ + v·lead\n  shown ← shown + (1 − e^(−Δt/12 ms))·(target − shown)",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "ht0216",
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
   "autoResize": true
  },
