   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "POINT TO BONE A→B\n\nu = clamp((p − a)·(b − a) / ‖b − a‖², 0, 1)\ndist = ‖p − (a + u·(b − a))‖",
   "originalText": "POINT TO BONE A→B\n\nu = clamp((p − a)·(b − a) / ‖b − a‖², 0, 1)\ndist = ‖p − (a + u·(b − a))‖",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
