   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "PICTURE PINCH\n\nq = image_xy · (aspect, 1)\nP = max(‖q[9] − q[0]‖, 1.25·‖q[5] − q[17]‖)\ngap_z = |z[4] − z[8]| · aspect / P\npicture pinch = ∞ if gap_z > 0.45, else ‖q[4] − q[8]‖ / P\n\nThe metric landmarks put touching fingertips a third of a palm apart,\nand most of a palm apart when the hand is side-on. The picture\nlandmarks sit on the fingertips, so the smaller reading is used.",
   "originalText": "PICTURE PINCH\n\nq = image_xy · (aspect, 1)\nP = max(‖q[9] − q[0]‖, 1.25·‖q[5] − q[17]‖)\ngap_z = |z[4] − z[8]| · aspect / P\npicture pinch = ∞ if gap_z > 0.45, else ‖q[4] − q[8]‖ / P\n\nThe metric landmarks put touching fingertips a third of a palm apart, and most of a palm apart when the hand is side-on. The picture landmarks sit on the fingertips, so the smaller reading is used.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "ht0237",
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
   "autoResize": true
