   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "DEBOUNCE: HOW LONG A CANDIDATE MUST LAST\n\ninto a pinch or press                30 ms\nout of a pinch or press              60 ms\ninto open, two-finger, aim, neutral  80 ms\ninto a fist                          90 ms\ninto claw, Y or ILY                  300 ms\n\nPinches are fast in and slow out, so a held window is not dropped by\none bad frame. Signs that open the microphone or the launcher wait\nlongest.",
   "originalText": "DEBOUNCE: HOW LONG A CANDIDATE MUST LAST\n\ninto a pinch or press                30 ms\nout of a pinch or press              60 ms\ninto open, two-finger, aim, neutral  80 ms\ninto a fist                          90 ms\ninto claw, Y or ILY                  300 ms\n\nPinches are fast in and slow out, so a held window is not dropped by one bad frame. Signs that open the microphone or the launcher wait longest.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "ht0347",
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
   "autoResize": true
  },
