   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "OPTIONAL REPLACEMENT [MODEL]\n\nIf [pose] model names a file from `holotouch train`, a small network\nsupplies the candidate instead of the rules:\n210 joint distances → 48 ReLU → softmax over 6 poses;\nunder 0.6 confidence reads as NEUTRAL.\nThe debounce still applies. Off by default.",
   "originalText": "OPTIONAL REPLACEMENT [MODEL]\n\nIf [pose] model names a file from `holotouch train`, a small network supplies the candidate instead of the rules:\n210 joint distances → 48 ReLU → softmax over 6 poses;\nunder 0.6 confidence reads as NEUTRAL.\nThe debounce still applies. Off by default.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "ht0351",
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
   "autoResize": true
  },
