   "text": "AIMED\n\nAIM held ≥ 200 ms  →  aimed = True\nPRESS              →  aimed unchanged (thumb may tap again)\nany other pose     →  aimed = False\n\nFingers folding into a point arrive before the thumb does, and for\nthat moment look like taking aim.",
   "originalText": "AIMED\n\nAIM held ≥ 200 ms  →  aimed = True\nPRESS              →  aimed unchanged (thumb may tap again)\nany other pose     →  aimed = False\n\nFingers folding into a point arrive before the thumb does, and for that moment look like taking aim.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
