   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "POSE → INTERACTION\n\npose             also needs                  begins\nPINCH_INDEX      window under the hand,      Move / resize\n                 not fullscreen\nPRESS            aimed                       Click / drag\nPINCH_PINKY                                  Pie menu\nFIST             window under the hand       Close\nTWO_FINGER       one hand                    Scroll\nTWO_FINGER × 2   both hands                  Camera\nCLAW             right / left hand           Volume / brightness\nY_SIGN                                       Dictate\nILY              something to spell          Spell (launcher)\nfist at chin     face visible                Window switcher\n\nA pose that cannot begin anything (a pinch over the bare desktop) is\nstill consumed. For 0.7 s after spelling, every pose of the hand that\nspelt is consumed on sight.",
   "originalText": "POSE → INTERACTION\n\npose             also needs                  begins\nPINCH_INDEX      window under the hand,      Move / resize\n                 not fullscreen\nPRESS            aimed                       Click / drag\nPINCH_PINKY                                  Pie menu\nFIST             window under the hand       Close\nTWO_FINGER       one hand                    Scroll\nTWO_FINGER × 2   both hands                  Camera\nCLAW             right / left hand           Volume / brightness\nY_SIGN                                       Dictate\nILY              something to spell          Spell (launcher)\nfist at chin     face visible                Window switcher\n\nA pose that cannot begin anything (a pinch over the bare desktop) is still consumed. For 0.7 s after spelling, every pose of the hand that spelt is consumed on sight.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "ht0471",
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
   "autoResize": true
  },
