   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Maximized?\nIt stays put until the hand drags past 0.05 H or a second\nhand pinches. Then it is restored and re-anchored at the\nsame relative grip:\nx = hand_x − grip_x·w\ny = max(hand_y − grip_y·h, work_y)",
   "originalText": "Maximized?\nIt stays put until the hand drags past 0.05 H or a second hand pinches. Then it is restored and re-anchored at the same relative grip:\nx = hand_x − grip_x·w\ny = max(hand_y − grip_y·h, work_y)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "ht0484",
   "lineHeight": 1.15,
   "autoResize": true
