   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Second hand pinches: resize\nw = clamp(w0 + (|x2 − x1| − Δx0)·gain, min_w, W)\nh = clamp(h0 + (|y2 − y1| − Δy0)·gain, min_h, H)\ncentre = centre0 + (midpoint − midpoint0)\nSize changes are sent at most 60 times a second. If one\nhand lets go, the other carries on moving.",
   "originalText": "Second hand pinches: resize\nw = clamp(w0 + (|x2 − x1| − Δx0)·gain, min_w, W)\nh = clamp(h0 + (|y2 − y1| − Δy0)·gain, min_h, H)\ncentre = centre0 + (midpoint − midpoint0)\nSize changes are sent at most 60 times a second. If one hand lets go, the other carries on moving.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "ht0490",
   "lineHeight": 1.15,
   "autoResize": true
