   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Let rest follow a sagging hand\nWhile still, short of scrolling down, and not leaning back\npast the dead zone:\nlean = ψ − rest\nrest ← rest + lean·(1 − e^(−Δt/τ))\nτ = 0.5 s if lean < 8°, else 0.8 s",
   "originalText": "Let rest follow a sagging hand\nWhile still, short of scrolling down, and not leaning back past the dead zone:\nlean = ψ − rest\nrest ← rest + lean·(1 − e^(−Δt/τ))\nτ = 0.5 s if lean < 8°, else 0.8 s",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "ht0531",
   "lineHeight": 1.15,
   "autoResize": true
