   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Rate, −1..1\ndown_from = max(rest + 8°, 60°)\nfull_at = max(rest + 40°, down_from + 20°)\nψ ≥ down_from:\n  rate = min((ψ − down_from)/(full_at − down_from), 1)\nlean ≤ −8° for ≥ 0.3 s:\n  rate = −min((−lean − 8°)/(25° − 8°), 1)\notherwise rate = 0",
   "originalText": "Rate, −1..1\ndown_from = max(rest + 8°, 60°)\nfull_at = max(rest + 40°, down_from + 20°)\nψ ≥ down_from:\n  rate = min((ψ − down_from)/(full_at − down_from), 1)\nlean ≤ −8° for ≥ 0.3 s:\n  rate = −min((−lean − 8°)/(25° − 8°), 1)\notherwise rate = 0",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "ht0534",
   "lineHeight": 1.15,
   "autoResize": true
