   "text": "Stays alive while\nthe pose is TWO_FINGER, or ψ ≥ 80° with the index not\ncurled (≥ 0.6), or index and middle stand out from ring and\npinky by ≥ 0.15 straightness. An unclear hand pauses it up\nto 0.3 s; an open hand ends it.",
