   "text": "Roll of the hand in the picture\nρ = atan2(Δy, Δx) of pinky knuckle − index knuckle\nturn ← turn + ((ρ − ρ_prev + 180) mod 360 − 180)\nunwrapped through full turns, then 1€ smoothed",
