   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Level\nlean = turn − rest\nmoved = sign(lean)·max(|lean| − 8°, 0) / 120°\nlevel = clamp(level0 + moved, lowest, 1)\nlowest = 0.05 for brightness, 0 for volume\nApplied when it changes by ≥ 0.01, at most every 50 ms.",
   "originalText": "Level\nlean = turn − rest\nmoved = sign(lean)·max(|lean| − 8°, 0) / 120°\nlevel = clamp(level0 + moved, lowest, 1)\nlowest = 0.05 for brightness, 0 for volume\nApplied when it changes by ≥ 0.01, at most every 50 ms.",
