   "text": "Open at the hand\nTarget: the window under the hand, else the focused one.\nItems at even angles, 0° up, clockwise:\nroot: θ_i = i·360/N\nsubmenu: θ_i = back + (i + 1)·360/(N + 1)",
   "originalText": "Open at the hand\nTarget: the window under the hand, else the focused one. Items at even angles, 0° up, clockwise:\nroot: θ_i = i·360/N\nsubmenu: θ_i = back + (i + 1)·360/(N + 1)",
