   "text": "Steer by direction only\n(dx, dy) = hand − centre, dist = ‖(dx, dy)‖\ndist ≤ 82 px (51 × ui scale 1.6): nothing aimed at\nθ = atan2(dx, −dy) mod 360\nhover = argmin_i |((θ − θ_i + 180) mod 360) − 180|",
   "originalText": "Steer by direction only\n(dx, dy) = hand − centre, dist = ‖(dx, dy)‖\ndist ≤ 82 px (51 × ui scale 1.6): nothing aimed at\nθ = atan2(dx, −dy) mod 360\nhover = argmin_i |((θ − θ_i + 180) mod 360) − 180|",
