   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "SCALE OF THE PICTURE AT THE HAND AND AT THE FACE\n\nspread(P) = √( mean_k ‖P_k − mean(P)‖² )     RMS radius\n\nimage_scale = spread(frame_points) / spread(world_xy)\n              frame heights per metre\n\nface.scale = max(height / 0.177 m, width / 0.153 m)\nface.size  = face.scale · 0.177      frame heights\n\nNodding shortens the face's height and turning shortens its width, so\nthe larger ratio is the truer. Chin, forehead and cheeks are 1€\nfiltered first.",
   "originalText": "SCALE OF THE PICTURE AT THE HAND AND AT THE FACE\n\nspread(P) = √( mean_k ‖P_k − mean(P)‖² )     RMS radius\n\nimage_scale = spread(frame_points) / spread(world_xy)\n              frame heights per metre\n\nface.scale = max(height / 0.177 m, width / 0.153 m)\nface.size  = face.scale · 0.177      frame heights\n\nNodding shortens the face's height and turning shortens its width, so the larger ratio is the truer. Chin, forehead and cheeks are 1€ filtered first.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "ht0747",
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "ht0749",
