   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "CHIN TEST\n\nreach     = min_k ‖frame_points[k] − chin‖ / face.size\ncloseness = image_scale / face.scale\n\nA fist under the chin measures 1.0–1.35 in closeness; a hand held out\nin front of the face 1.5–2.",
   "originalText": "CHIN TEST\n\nreach     = min_k ‖frame_points[k] − chin‖ / face.size\ncloseness = image_scale / face.scale\n\nA fist under the chin measures 1.0–1.35 in closeness; a hand held out in front of the face 1.5–2.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "ht0749",
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
   "autoResize": true
  },
