   "text": "SWIPE\n\nstart = max(now − 350 ms, pose_since, swipe_since)\n(x0, y0) = leftmost point of the history since start\ndx = x − x0,  dy = y − y0\nfire if dx ≥ 0.30·W and dx ≥ 2.5·|dy|",
   "originalText": "SWIPE\n\nstart = max(now − 350 ms, pose_since, swipe_since)\n(x0, y0) = leftmost point of the history since start\ndx = x − x0,  dy = y − y0\nfire if dx ≥ 0.30·W and dx ≥ 2.5·|dy|",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "ht0753",
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
