   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "FEATURES\n\nP = image · (aspect, 1, aspect) − wrist\npalm = mean(‖P[5]‖, ‖P[9]‖, ‖P[17]‖)       P ← P / palm\n\nKEY = 15 joints: wrist, 5 tips, 4 knuckles,\n      5 joints below the tips\nx = [ P[1..20] flattened                 (60)\n      ‖P[a] − P[b]‖ for a < b in KEY ]   (105)\n\nUnchanged by where the hand is or how large. It does change with\nwhich way the hand points, as it must: G is the hand of D lying on\nits side.",
   "originalText": "FEATURES\n\nP = image · (aspect, 1, aspect) − wrist\npalm = mean(‖P[5]‖, ‖P[9]‖, ‖P[17]‖)       P ← P / palm\n\nKEY = 15 joints: wrist, 5 tips, 4 knuckles,\n      5 joints below the tips\nx = [ P[1..20] flattened                 (60)\n      ‖P[a] − P[b]‖ for a < b in KEY ]   (105)\n\nUnchanged by where the hand is or how large. It does change with which way the hand points, as it must: G is the hand of D lying on its side.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "ht0773",
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
   "autoResize": true
  },
