   "locked": false,
   "text": "Measure\nFive-fold held-out: 98% of public hands read right,\nthough the same people are on both sides of each split.\n`train-letters` saves yours to\n~/.config/holotouch/letters.npz, which is then used.",
   "originalText": "Measure\nFive-fold held-out: 98% of public hands read right, though the same people are on both sides of each split. `train-letters` saves yours to ~/.config/holotouch/letters.npz, which is then used.",
