   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "LOSS AND OPTIMISER\n\nw_n ∝ 1 / (weight of n's class)    letters count alike\n∂L/∂logits = (p − y)·w_n           weighted cross-entropy\ng ← g + 1e−4·W                     L2 on both matrices\n\nm ← 0.9·m + 0.1·g       v ← 0.999·v + 0.001·g²\nm̂ = m/(1 − 0.9^t)       v̂ = v/(1 − 0.999^t)\nθ ← θ − 0.01·m̂ / (√v̂ + 1e−8)",
   "originalText": "LOSS AND OPTIMISER\n\nw_n ∝ 1 / (weight of n's class)    letters count alike\n∂L/∂logits = (p − y)·w_n           weighted cross-entropy\ng ← g + 1e−4·W                     L2 on both matrices\n\nm ← 0.9·m + 0.1·g       v ← 0.999·v + 0.001·g²\nm̂ = m/(1 − 0.9^t)       v̂ = v/(1 − 0.999^t)\nθ ← θ − 0.01·m̂ / (√v̂ + 1e−8)",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "ht0793",
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
