   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "CONTROL AND TUNING\n\nThe core listens on $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/holotouch.sock for pause,\nresume, toggle, debug, status, info, say and quit; the panel and\n`holotouch ctl` are its clients.\n\nThresholds are tuned against recordings: `collect` prompts each pose\nand records it, `score` replays the recording through this same code\nand reports what each prompt was read as.",
   "originalText": "CONTROL AND TUNING\n\nThe core listens on $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/holotouch.sock for pause, resume, toggle, debug, status, info, say and quit; the panel and `holotouch ctl` are its clients.\n\nThresholds are tuned against recordings: `collect` prompts each pose and records it, `score` replays the recording through this same code and reports what each prompt was read as.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "ht0828",
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
   "autoResize": true
  }
